Optional NVIDIA NVAPI/NVNGX DLLs in the official upstream CI package are not
installed by this integration. The external/nvapi gitlink is recorded but
not fetched. No proprietary Apple GPTK/D3DMetal runtime is used by the DXMT
probe. macOS/Metal are OS dependencies.

Upstream AGENTS.md prohibits AI-generated code contributions to DXMT.
No DXMT source was edited and no upstream contribution was prepared.
